The watch captain in minetown has a 50-50 chance silver saber
or long sword.  If your pet accidentally had him for lunch,
you'd know which by now.  It can be worth grooming a pet just
for the stuff gotten on the way back up from mines end.  Or
it can be worth being chaotic and doing it yourself.

Soldiers starting at a certain rank have a chance of getting
a silver saber, so if your dungeon had Ludios you'll likely
get one later in the huge pile of loot.  Without source in
front of me I don't offhand recall exactly what rank, but
I've gotten silver sabers off of cooperatively hostile
captains.

Angels have a 50-50 chance of rustproof large shield or
shield of reflection.  I wonder if there's an angelic type
that donates silver sabers when properly motivated by death.
I only recall long swords recently.

